tasks.note:
⚠ O'zbekiston haqida javob namunasi.

'a pass' = dovon;
'a railway' = temir yo'l;
'to connect' = bog'lamoq.

⚠ 'There IS a tunnel' — birlik;
'There ARE tunnels' — ko'plik.

⚠ 'a teapot' = choynak (IDISH);
'a pot of tea' = choynakdagi CHOY.

⚠ 'a saucer' = piyola tagidagi kichik
likobcha (ovqat likobchasi 'a plate').

⚠ 'china' kichik harf bilan = CHINNI;
'China' bosh harf bilan = XITOY!
